1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:02,805
Lim Su-do
the third-year student

2
00:00:02,888 --> 00:00:05,335
You shouldn't mention
that name

3
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:07,545
You're working out
to beat him, right?

4
00:00:08,884 --> 00:00:10,244
How long do you think
that'll take?

5
00:00:11,231 --> 00:00:13,973
Just ask Lim Su-do
to help you

6
00:00:14,056 --> 00:00:15,351
take down Lee Hyeon-wu

7
00:00:17,379 --> 00:00:18,379
Hyeong-ju

8
00:00:20,106 --> 00:00:22,022
You're the strongest
guy in your grade

9
00:00:23,315 --> 00:00:25,108
It was
worth watching you

10
00:00:25,651 --> 00:00:27,110
We're third-years now

11
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:29,296
so we have to focus
on studying

12
00:00:30,948 --> 00:00:32,793
You're the boss
of our school now

13
00:00:34,528 --> 00:00:35,528
Do a good job

14
00:00:36,642 --> 00:00:37,312
Su-do

15
00:00:37,395 --> 00:00:40,173
Until then, Daemun High
was my world

16
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:41,797
The boss spot
and Hong Il-tak

17
00:00:42,457 --> 00:00:44,336
were all mine

18
00:00:44,419 --> 00:00:45,419
You son of a b****

19
00:00:45,862 --> 00:00:48,244
Do I look
like a pushover to you?

20
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:50,400
If anyone beats him
it'll be me

21
00:00:51,556 --> 00:00:53,387
Stop telling me
what to do

22
00:00:53,875 --> 00:00:54,875
Get lost

23
00:01:01,277 --> 00:01:03,336
I don't want Su-do
involved in this

24
00:01:03,938 --> 00:01:06,366
He's known
for being cruel

25
00:01:06,774 --> 00:01:08,060
Besides, I have my pride

26
00:01:08,573 --> 00:01:10,770
That guy is dangerous

27
00:01:15,993 --> 00:01:17,903
Should I apologize
with this?

28
00:01:19,292 --> 00:01:20,292
Who knows?

29
00:01:20,838 --> 00:01:23,000
Maybe he'll be moved
by my kindness

30
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:24,559
I'll just be
his errand boy

31
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:28,517
How low can I sink?

32
00:01:31,762 --> 00:01:32,762
Hey, Hong Il-tak

33
00:01:34,458 --> 00:01:35,458
We need to talk
